#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:8
msgid "Set language"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:10
msgid ""
"In a board, set your preferred language by selecting the gear icon |gear|"
" next to your profile picture, then go to **Set language** to apply your "
"language settings.  Language settings in Boards are independent from "
"language settings in Channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:13
msgid "Random emoji icons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:15
msgid ""
"To enable or disable random emoji icons for your board and cards, select "
"the gear icon |gear| next to your profile picture, then toggle **Random "
"icons on or off**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:18
msgid "Product tour"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/boards-settings.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you skipped the product tour or want a refresher on Boards, you can "
"restart the product tour by going to the gear icon |gear| next to your "
"profile picture and selecting **Product tour**. This will add a new "
"**Welcome to Boards** template to your sidebar and kick-off the guided "
"onboarding tour."
msgstr ""

